# Step 3 prototype, the plan generator it feeds and the throwaway work copy of each amendment (moved in from
# the session scratchpad on 2026-09-26, which had pruned them twice). Their code is version-controlled since
# 2026-10-08; their run outputs are not -- tens to hundreds of MB per work copy, every one re-made from the
# tracked code and the command lines in its logs and in the sub-plans. See Reentry Model/prototype/README.md.
# (reentry_model_output/ and __pycache__/ below cover the cached meshes and bytecode in each copy.)
